  "content": "<h1><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fr%252fbareneil%252fminecraft-server-hosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1475587/description_7bacedcb-1d61-4bd0-8d04-cb8a0b267406.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"81\"></a></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Анимации еды — большая совместимость с модами [NEO/FORGE]</a> и <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[FABRIC]</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1751/483/639114741005949896.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></em></a><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1748/995/639113051020661900.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></a></em></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>Другие совместимости по частям:</strong></em></span></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-quark-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/885/256/256/639148225207339732.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-aether-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/866/256/256/639148221311503481.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/873/256/256/639148222209502373.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-farmers-delight-add-ons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/875/256/256/639148223190593815.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/879/256/256/639148224173941263.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1813/752/256/256/639146533871866822.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p><p><strong>Добавлена совместимость с модами, использующими&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations (NEO/FORGE)</a></strong></p><h3><strong>Совместимость и исправления для модов:</strong></h3><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Redux</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fartifacts-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction [Fabric]</a>/</strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Forge]</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Born in Chaos</strong></a></li>\n<li><strong>Born In Chaos Delight </strong>(От <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/compat-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Compat Delight</a></strong>)</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-of-yucutan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Call of Yucatán</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Caverns &amp; Chasms</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critters-n-crawlers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Critters n' Crawlers</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/drop-the-meat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Drop the Meat</a>&nbsp; </strong><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">(Совместить с <strong>Eating Animations+</strong>)</a></em></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ender's Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight [Forge]</a></strong><strong>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Fabric]</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fungi-stew\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fungi Stew</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffungus-stew\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fungus Stew</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgolden-delicacies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Golden Delicacies</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inka\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inka</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jadens-nether-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jaden's Nether Expansion</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/legionary\" rel=\"nofollow\">Legionary</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-beachparty\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Beachparty</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-meadow\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Meadow</a></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-n-explore\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loot &amp; Explore (Больше RPG-контента)</a>&nbsp;</strong>&amp;<strong>&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fichteee/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">(<strong>LNE Add-Ons</strong>)</a></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Minecraft</span></strong><strong> </strong><em>(Мелкие детали)</em></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mineral-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mineral Delight</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Delight</a> </strong><strong>&amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-delight-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Fabric]</a><br></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oceans-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ocean's&nbsp;Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/queen-bee\" rel=\"nofollow\">Queen Bee</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/queen-cats-dogs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Queen Cats &amp; Dogs</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slimy-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\">Slimy Stuff</a></strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Supplementaries</strong></a>&nbsp; <em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">(Совместить с <strong>Eating Animations+</strong>)</a></em></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rotten-creatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rotten Creatures</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest</a> </strong><em>&nbsp;</em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/twilight-forest-jappa-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>(Совместить с <strong>Twilight Forest: JAPPA Pack</strong></em></a> &amp; <em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Eating Animations+</strong>)</a></em></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilights-flavors-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight's Flavors &amp; Delight</a> </strong>&nbsp;<em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">(Совместить с <strong>Eating Animations+</strong>)</a></em></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftwilight-forest-artifacts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest Artifacts</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-cookbook\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Cookbook</a> &nbsp;</strong><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">(Совместить с <strong>Eating Animations+</strong>)</a></em></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/victus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Victus</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-cave-biomes\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Cave Biomes (Forge/NeoForge)</a></strong><strong>|<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-cave-biomes-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">(Fabric)</a></strong></li>\n</ul><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1223426/description_fbfb144e-1998-4370-815d-f73791617f33.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"406\" height=\"406\"></strong></em></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>Другие совместимости с ресурспаками по частям:</strong></em></span></h3><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-better-vanilla-foods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1549/883/639005939687349561.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></strong></em></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Определённый порядок (чтобы избежать любых текстурных ошибок)</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Я рекомендую установить (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations+</a>), потому что этот пакет также исправляет некоторые ошибки в версии 1.20.x</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1223426/description_24310386-f0aa-43e9-8b0d-fbe6ef1011bd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"776\" height=\"500\"></strong></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Некоторые блюда совместимы с Eat Animation (включая настройки Eatanimations+ 1.10)</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d1e2deee1ea1bba9bd4a9a726b6b4ebbf14d9bae.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"864\" height=\"612\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Этот пакет добавляет новые совместимости и исправляет проблемы из другого пакета</h2><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>Другие модификации, совместимые по частям:</strong></em></span></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-mod-support-unofficial\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_886b93b4-5b1b-4f7b-9199-8a77673e6d94.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_ce3f13f1-92b8-43b7-8bb5-88d86e2b8438.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/enchantment-descriptions-more-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_9167534c-99ad-4182-95af-5bc9f849e1bd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p><div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"width:22px\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"width:300px;font-size:13px\">\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
